    {
      "type": "function",
      "function": {
        "name": "semantic_graph",
        "description": "Semantic network graph traversal tool, three modes:\n\n1. query_neighbors (default): query the relationship neighbors of an entity, with optional direction and relation type filtering; supports table, metric, concept, column_concept.\n2. trace_lineage: trace the complete lineage of a metric (parse dependent tables from metric SQL)\n3. metrics_by_table: reverse lookup of metrics that depend on a given table\n\nTypical usage:\n- Which business concepts does a table belong to? → mode=query_neighbors, entity_type=table, direction=incoming (may return relation_type=concept soft reference neighbors)\n- What candidate tables are under a business concept? → mode=query_neighbors, entity_type=concept, direction=outgoing\n- Which column-level concepts do a table's columns belong to? → mode=query_neighbors, entity_type=table, direction=incoming, relation_type=column_concept\n- What candidate columns are under a column-level concept? → mode=query_neighbors, entity_type=column_concept, direction=outgoing\n- Which tables does a metric depend on? → mode=trace_lineage, metric_id=xxx\n- Complete lineage tree of a metric? → mode=trace_lineage, metric_id=xxx\n- Which metrics does this table support? → mode=metrics_by_table, table_id=xxx",
        "parameters": {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "mode": {
              "type": "string",
              "description": "Traversal mode: query_neighbors(neighbors) / trace_lineage(lineage) / metrics_by_table(reverse metric lookup).",
              "enum": [
                "query_neighbors",
                "trace_lineage",
                "metrics_by_table"
              ]
            },
            "entity_type": {
              "type": "string",
              "description": "Required for mode=query_neighbors: starting entity type.",
              "enum": [
                "table",
                "metric",
                "concept",
                "column_concept"
              ]
            },
            "entity_id": {
              "type": "string",
              "description": "Required for mode=query_neighbors: starting entity ID."
            },
            "metric_id": {
              "type": "string",
              "description": "Required for mode=trace_lineage: metric ID to trace lineage for."
            },
            "table_id": {
              "type": "string",
              "description": "Required for mode=metrics_by_table: table ID."
            },
            "direction": {
              "type": "string",
              "description": "Optional for mode=query_neighbors: traversal direction. Default both.",
              "enum": [
                "outgoing",
                "incoming",
                "both"
